# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Everything under output/ is regenerated by train.py / the visualize + marker
# scripts, so none of it is tracked. The only copy that needs to survive a
# checkout is the app's, which `npm run sync-ml-model` writes to
# utils/repCountingModel/. Tracking these too meant every retrain committed
# hundreds of KB of duplicated forests, and left stale reports behind whenever
# the pipeline's output shape changed.
output/
recordings/*
raw-data/*
!raw-data/PRIVACY.md
